{"code":"018620","name":"우진비앤지","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"제약","sector_desc":"의약품을 개발·생산·판매. 신약 파이프라인과 임상 결과, 약가 정책에 주가가 크게 반응합니다.","desc":"동사는 1985년 동물용 의약품 제조·판매 목적으로 설립, 2008년 코스닥 상장하였으며, 종속회사로 ㈜오에스피와 ㈜바우와우코리아를 보유하고 있음. 동사는 동물용의약품, 인체원료의약품, 미생물제제, 백신 등을 제조·판매하고, 오에스피는 프리미엄 건식사료 ODM 및 자체브랜드를, 바우와우코리아는 고품질 간식을 생산·판매하고 있음. 동사는 기술력 기반 자체 제품 개발로 국내외 시장 영향력을 확대하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-19","n_days":298,"close":2660.0,"open":2555.0,"high":2680.0,"low":2525.0,"volume":5277,"amount":14036820.0,"ret_1d":4.1096,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":5.8271,"ret_5":-1.1152,"ret_20":0.0,"ret_60":9.0164,"ret_120":-15.9558,"ret_250":-27.5993,"ma20":2701.0,"ma60":2681.25,"ma120":2701.4667,"ma200":2898.075,"close_vs_ma200":-8.2149,"close_vs_ma60":-0.7925,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":24.166,"r2_60":0.1257,"slope_120":-13.39,"r2_120":0.0544,"slope_250":-33.6782,"r2_250":0.7383,"high52":4362.0,"low52":2120.0,"pos_52w":24.0856,"dd_52w":-39.0188,"mdd_1y":-39.8446,"atr14_pct":6.5387,"vol_ann_60":62.8735,"vol_avg20":10190.75,"vol_ratio20":0.5178,"vr5":0.3953,"vr20":0.3433,"amount_avg5":21215712.0,"amount_avg20":27692953.5,"amount_avg60":51631996.0833,"obv_chg20":-0.5132,"turnover_20":2.9398,"pv_eff_20":0.0,"rsi14":48.9302,"frgn_net_5":7328.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.1057,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.1057,"frgn_net_20":5687.0,"inst_net_20":23.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.082,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0003,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0824,"frgn_net_60":-10824.0,"inst_net_60":-1983.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.1561,"inst_net_60_pct":-0.0286,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.1847,"frgn_net_120":-65628.0,"inst_net_120":93643.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.9466,"inst_net_120_pct":1.3507,"smart_net_120_pct":0.4041,"foreign_ratio":1.82,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.33,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":14.0,"op_margin_q":9.0323,"op_qoq":100.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":600.0,"rev_yoy":13.1387,"op_trend_4q":80.0,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-8.2,"debt_ratio":64.94,"per":null,"pbr":0.58,"div_yield":null,"foreign